# =============================================================================
# Shipping - Storefront Shipping Methods & Rates API Smoke Tests
# =============================================================================

### List shipping methods – no auth (401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/storefront/shipping/methods

### List shipping methods – success (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/storefront/shipping/methods
Authorization: Bearer {{storeToken}}

### List shipping rates – no auth (401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/storefront/shipping/rates

### List shipping rates – success (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/storefront/shipping/rates?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{storeToken}}
